WEBVTT

00:01:27.704 --> 00:01:30.038
they have Native American blood in them.

00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:32.746
And I added in French, I lied,

00:01:32.746 --> 00:01:35.038
My father had been
stationed in France,

00:01:35.079 --> 00:01:38.038
but I wanted to have a history also.

00:01:38.079 --> 00:01:42.913
That sense of not knowing
and not belonging

00:01:42.913 --> 00:01:48.288
stayed with me until my sophomore year
at Brandeis University.

00:01:49.246 --> 00:01:51.746
I remember it like it was yesterday.

00:01:52.413 --> 00:01:54.829
It was a fall day.

00:01:55.829 --> 00:01:58.538
The leaves were a golden brown.

00:01:59.121 --> 00:02:02.371
And I’m in New York’s Schomburg Library